{
  "about": "Eudoria's revival areas and the zone each revival terminal served, from PE WikiCharts' Locations map as captured on 2006-11-27 (Media vvsgpk3w), its lines traced by hand (the Archive editor's tools/revival.py), in the game's own coordinates, the longitude and latitude its readout printed, in metres: each area a box [west, south, east, north], each zone a polygon of [longitude, latitude] corners and its centre. The site drew them as 'Lines' and never named them; their reading as revival areas and zones is the Archive's.",
  "sources": [["pe-wikicharts", "vvsgpk3w"]],
  "note": "The picture's frame is fitted to 33 of the site's 35 Eudoria teleporters (29.4 m a pixel), so a corner is good to some 60 m.",
